// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// StreamWriter — writev/sendmsg vectored emission to a UDS in fixed emit
// order: continuation, metaSize, meta, metaPad, body, bodyPad, EOS.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

// oabiEmitOrder is the fixed vectored emit-order table (documentation as
// data: the writer below emits frames in exactly this order).
